      '征程系列 2025 出货超 400 万套 +39%，中高阶 180 万套 +近 5 倍',
      '累计出货突破 1000 万套（2025-08），40+ 车企，400+ 车型',
      '2026H1 营收 20.55 亿 +32.9%，出货 221.8 万套，调整后净亏 16.71 亿',
      '2026H1 自主品牌 ADAS 份额首破 50%，城区 NOA 芯片份额 22.8%',
      '2025-08 第 1000 万套为征程6M，客户吉利（千里浩瀚 H3）',
    ],
  },
  {
    tag: '厂商宣称待验',
    tone: 'warn',
    items: [
      '"计算性能十年提升超 1000 倍，超越摩尔定律"',
      '"每三台智能汽车就有一台搭载地平线"',
      '"未来 3-5 年 HSD 达成千万量产"',
      '"未来 3-5 年无人物流车部署规模有望达百万辆"',
      '征程6P 相比特斯拉 HW3.0 的性能对比（厂商发布会口径）',
      '均为官方发布会与业绩会表述，无第三方实测',
    ],
  },
  {
    tag: '第三方口径 / 存疑',
    tone: 'none',
    items: [
      '2026H1 按装机量口径仅 3.3 万辆排第六（第一电动网），与官方"千万级出货"表述存在口径差异',
      'L2+ 第三方方案市占率 8.4% 排第五（易车榜），系统口径远低于芯片口径',
      '征程6 系列制程节点未公开（纳什架构自研，但制程归属不明）',
      'HSD 实际交付量与 ASP 未单独披露',
      '具身智能 / Robotaxi 业务尚无实质收入',
    ],
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} locale="zh" pathPrefix="/insights/horizon-robotics" showLang={false}>
  <section class="border-b border-slate-200/80 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-transparent py-16 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-900/50">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400">Industry Insight · Automotive Chips</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">地平线机器人：千万级出货，与系统话语权的落差</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        地平线（9660.HK）不是车企，也不是传统 Tier1 —— 它同时是吉利、比亚迪、理想、奇瑞的芯片供应商，
        又是它们在智驾方案上的竞争对手。本文拆解它的四代产品线、20 段里程碑、两个互相矛盾的市场份额榜单，
        以及「车企自研会不会杀死它」这个核心争议。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        数据来源：地平线官方、经济参考报（新华社）、中国经济网、21 世纪经济报道、招银国际、OFweek、界面新闻、易车榜、百度第一电动网 · 截至 2026-09
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
        <a href="../geely-chips/" class="font-semibold text-accent-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-800 dark:text-accent-400">吉利造芯 →</a>
        <span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span>
        <a href="../byd-chips/" class="font-semibold text-accent-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-800 dark:text-accent-400">比亚迪造芯 →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 关键数字 -->
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {kpis.map((k) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold tabular-nums text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400">{k.metric}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">{k.label}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">{k.detail}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 组织架构 -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">一、组织架构：一家有四种身份的公司</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
        {org.map((o) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{o.entity}</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400">{o.role}</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{o.detail}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 双业务线 -->
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 py-16 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">二、双业务线：卖芯片（基本盘）+ 卖系统（增量）</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5">
        {lines.map((l) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{l.name}</h3>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-accent-800 dark:bg-accent-900/40 dark:text-accent-300">{l.type}</span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300">{l.badge}</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2">
              {l.specs.map((sp) => (
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                  <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600"></span>
                  <span>{sp}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold">关键节点：</span>{l.position}
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 rounded-xl bg-accent-50 p-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:bg-accent-950/30 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold">解读：</span>{l.note}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 时间线 -->
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 py-16 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">三、里程碑时间线（2019 – 2026）</h2>
      <ol class="mt-8 space-y-0 border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-6 dark:border-slate-800">
        {timeline.map((t) => (
          <li class="relative pb-6">
            <span class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1.5 h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-accent-600 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950"></span>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold tabular-nums text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400">{t.date}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{t.event}</p>
            {t.note && <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{t.note}</p>}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 竞争格局 -->
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 py-16 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{landscape.title}</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[820px] border-collapse text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700">
              {landscape.headers.map((h, i) => (
                <th class:list={[
                  'px-3 py-3 font-semibold',
                  i === 0 && 'text-left text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100',
                  i === 6 && 'text-left text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400',
                ]}>{h}</th>
              ))}
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {landscape.rows.map((r) => (
              <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 align-top dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-3 py-3 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">{r.metric}</td>
                {r.cells.map((c, i) => (
                  <td class:list={['px-3 py-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300', i === 4 && 'text-slate-400']}>{c}</td>
                ))}
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 space-y-2">
        {landscape.rows.map((r) => (
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">· {r.metric} — {r.note}</p>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 三方对标 -->
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 py-16 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{vsOEM.title}</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[820px] border-collapse text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700">
              {vsOEM.headers.map((h, i) => (
                <th class:list={[
                  'px-3 py-3 font-semibold',
                  i === 0 && 'text-left text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100',
                  i === 1 && 'text-left text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400',
                  i === 2 && 'text-left text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400',
                  i === 3 && 'text-left text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400',
                ]}>{h}</th>
              ))}
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {vsOEM.rows.map((r) => (
              <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 align-top dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-3 py-3 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">{r.dim}</td>
                <td class="px-3 py-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{r.hz}</td>
                <td class="px-3 py-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{r.geely}</td>
                <td class="px-3 py-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{r.byd}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 核心争议 -->
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 py-16 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{debate.question}</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60 p-6 dark:border-emerald-900/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-400">{debate.blue.label}</h3>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
            {debate.blue.points.map((p) => (
              <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
                <span>{p}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/60 p-6 dark:border-amber-900/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-400">{debate.red.label}</h3>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
            {debate.red.points.map((p) => (
              <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-600"></span>
                <span>{p}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-6 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{debate.verdict.label}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{debate.verdict.text}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 洞察 -->
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 py-16 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">五、八条洞察</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        {insights.map((i) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold tabular-nums text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400">{i.n}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{i.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{i.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 证据边界 -->
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 py-12 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">证据边界</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {evidence.map((e) => (
          <div class:list={[
            'rounded-2xl border p-5',
            e.tone === 'ok' && 'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60 dark:border-emerald-900/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20',
            e.tone === 'warn' && 'border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/60 dark:border-amber-900/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20',
            e.tone === 'none' && 'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900',
          ]}>
            <p class:list={[
              'text-sm font-bold',
              e.tone === 'ok' && 'text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-400',
              e.tone === 'warn' && 'text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-400',
              e.tone === 'none' && 'text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300',
            ]}>{e.tag}</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              {e.items.map((i) => <li>· {i}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>